 * XILINX_PLATFORM, which the vendor driver's own headers key off of.
 * Included by an EXPLICIT relative path (not a plain "app_config.h") on
 * purpose: a plain quote-include only finds it if "ad9361/src" happens to
 * be on the project's include path, which is a Vitis project setting this
 * source tree cannot set for you - see ad9361/src/app_config.h's header
 * comment for why the file has to live there. The relative path below
 * works regardless of that setting, for this one include. It does NOT get
 * you out of adding "ad9361/src" to the include path, though: the vendor
 * file ad9361_conv.c (noos/drivers/rf-transceiver/ad9361/ad9361_conv.c),
 * which ad9361_init() calls into via ad9361_post_setup(), does a plain
 * #include "app_config.h" that only the project include path can resolve -
 * see INTEGRATION_NOTES.md "app_config.h path bug" for the required Vitis
 * project setting. */
